This is a terminal game!
its still under development.

For this to work you HAVE to have python installed on your computer!

(WINDOWS) 
1. launch the game by double cliking the play game.bat file (in the test folder)
2. You can also open the folder in an editor such as VS Code or PyCharm and run Game_test.05.py

(LINUX) 
if you are on Linux it will not work, because i used (msvcrt) which takes windows-only-keyboard inputs.
(if you really want it to work on linux just replace msvcrt.getwch() with input() and fix the logic, if you do this use method 2)